[{"text":"Isolate[expr] substitutes abbreviations KK[i] for all Plus[...] (sub-sums) in expr. The inserted KK[i] have head HoldForm. Isolate[expr, varlist] substitutes KK[i] for all subsums in expr which are free of any occurrence of a member of the list varlist. Instead of KK any other head or a list of names of the abbreviations may be specified with the option IsolateNames.","anchor":"isolate"},{"text":"Overview, IsolateNames, Collect2.","anchor":"see-also","section":"See also"},{"text":"t0 = Isolate[a + b]","anchor":"cb1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{KK}(19)\\]","anchor":"cb1-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"t1 = Isolate[(a + b) f + (c + d) f + e, f]","anchor":"cb2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[e+f \\;\\text{KK}(19)+f \\;\\text{KK}(20)\\]","anchor":"cb2-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"StandardForm[t1]","anchor":"cb3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[e+f \\;\\text{KK}[19]+f \\;\\text{KK}[20]\\]","anchor":"cb3-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"{t0, t1, ReleaseHold[t1]}","anchor":"cb4","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\{\\text{KK}(19),e+f \\;\\text{KK}(19)+f \\;\\text{KK}(20),f (a+b)+f (c+d)+e\\}\\]","anchor":"cb4-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Isolate[a[z] (b + c (y + z)) + d[z] (y + z), {a, d}, IsolateNames -> fF]","anchor":"cb5","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{fF}(22) a(z)+\\text{fF}(21) d(z)\\]","anchor":"cb5-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Information[fF]","anchor":"cb6","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Global`fF","anchor":"cb7","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{fF}\\]","anchor":"cb7-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"fF[26] = y + z","anchor":"cb8","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[y+z\\]","anchor":"cb8-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"fF[27] = b + c HoldForm[fF[26]]","anchor":"cb9","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[b+c \\;\\text{fF}(26)\\]","anchor":"cb9-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Isolate[a - b - c - d - e, IsolateNames -> l, IsolateSplit -> 15]","anchor":"cb10","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[l(24)\\]","anchor":"cb10-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Clear[t0, t1, l, fF]","anchor":"cb11","section":"Examples"}]